{"id":"c24c7e81186cbc4b","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-fourier-transform.md","title":"Fourier Transform","display":"df-fourier-transform — Fourier Transform","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fourier-transform","aliases":["58-df-fourier-transform","58-df-zfc-ana-fourier-transform"],"display":"df-fourier-transform — Fourier Transform","depends_on":["[[58-df-bochner-integral]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-exponential]]","[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fourier-transform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fourier-transform</span><span>58-df-zfc-ana-fourier-transform</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fourier-transform — Fourier Transform"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e0348ed2298c600\" href=\"?note=9e0348ed2298c600\" title=\"58-df-bochner-integral\">58-df-bochner-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"58-df-exponential\">58-df-exponential</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\">\\(\\widehat f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\xi\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> (frequency variable)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n\">\\(\\lambda_n\\)</span> (Lebesgue measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\\)</span> (complex-valued integral predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e0348ed2298c600\" href=\"?note=9e0348ed2298c600\" title=\"58-df-bochner-integral\">58-df-bochner-integral</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\">\\(\\exp\\)</span> (complex exponential, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"58-df-exponential\">58-df-exponential</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n\">\\(\\lambda_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^n\">\\(\\lambda^n\\)</span> 及限制测度均取 <code>58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data</code> 的规范数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 用长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的实数函数编码。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fourier\\text{-}transform} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S(f,\\widehat f,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\land\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(g(x)=|f(x)|)\\land\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(c,g,\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n),\\lambda_n,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),\\mathbb R,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R},|\\cdot|)\\Bigr)\\land\\widehat f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists h_\\xi\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(h_\\xi(x)=f(x)\\exp(-2\\pi i\\,x\\cdot\\xi))\\land\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(\\widehat f(\\xi),h_\\xi,\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n),\\lambda_n,\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C),\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},|\\cdot|)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fourier\\text{-}transform} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S(f,\\widehat f,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\land\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(g(x)=|f(x)|)\\land\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(c,g,\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n),\\lambda_n,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),\\mathbb R,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R},|\\cdot|)\\Bigr)\\land\\widehat f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists h_\\xi\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(h_\\xi(x)=f(x)\\exp(-2\\pi i\\,x\\cdot\\xi))\\land\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(\\widehat f(\\xi),h_\\xi,\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n),\\lambda_n,\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C),\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},|\\cdot|)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This normalization uses the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\pi\">\\(2\\pi\\)</span> convention; both integrals now call the registered eleven-place Bochner-integral graph with the value argument first.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-bochner-integral","status":"resolved","id":"9e0348ed2298c600","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bochner-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-exponential]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bochner-integral","status":"resolved","id":"9e0348ed2298c600","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S$ (complex-valued integral predicate, see [[58-df-bochner-integral]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-6","targetA